; Spirograph rosette - hypotrochoid R=11 r=4 d=7, 11 petals.
; ONE continuous stroke, no pen lifts. 150 mm across.
; Starts AND ends at the centre, so there is no lead-in line to give away
; that the pen never lifts.
;
;   >>> PLACE THE PEN AT THE CENTRE of the Hilbert square. <<<
;   75 mm in from two adjacent edges. Use a different coloured pen.
;
; The rosette is a 150 mm circle inscribed in the Hilbert's 150 mm square,
; so the maze corners stay visible around it.
